# "If it stops being a creature, its power is considered to be 0" (Old Man of the Sea's ruling; CR 611.2b). Bot2 crews
# Smuggler's Copter (a 3/3 artifact creature until end of turn). Bot1 pumps Old Man to 4/5 with Battlefield Improvisation
# and, with the Copter's power 3 no more than Old Man's 4, takes it. When the turn ends both effects end together: Old Man
# is 2/3 again and the Copter no Vehicle creature, so its power counts as 0 - not its printed 3 - and Bot1 keeps it,
# still holding it on Bot1's turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Island
Old Man of the Sea
Mox Pearl
Plains
Battlefield Improvisation
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Smuggler's Copter
Forest x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Old Man of the Sea.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Smuggler's Copter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter.Activate(Ability: Crew)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter.Power = 3
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Battlefield Improvisation.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Old Man of the Sea)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Old Man of the Sea.Power = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Old Man of the Sea.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter.Types = Artifact; Creature
Bot1.Decline
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Old Man of the Sea.Power = 2

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Sapphire; Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Island; Plains; Old Man of the Sea; Smuggler's Copter
Bot1.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter.Types = Artifact
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Llanowar Elves
